# Blackbox — Cursor rules (this repo)

Follow **what exists in this tree**, not older drafts that used `apps/backend`, `apps/admin-web`, `apps/pos-electron`, Supabase Auth, Zod-everywhere, or RLS middleware.

Longer reference: `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/auth-api.md`, `docs/sync.md`.

## Monorepo layout (Turborepo + pnpm)

```
blackbox/
├── apps/
│   ├── api/          # @blackbox/api — NestJS + TypeORM
│   ├── web/          # @blackbox/web — Next.js App Router (admin)
│   └── desktop/      # @blackbox/desktop — Electron + Vite + React
├── packages/
│   ├── shared/       # @blackbox/shared — permissions, DTOs, validation helpers
│   ├── ui/           # @blackbox/ui — shadcn / Radix / Tailwind
│   ├── eslint-config/
│   └── typescript-config/
├── supabase/
│   └── migrations/   # schema source of truth (plural)
├── docs/
├── turbo.json
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml
└── package.json
```

Package scope is always `@blackbox/*`. Workspace deps use `workspace:*`.

**Do not** create `apps/backend`, `apps/admin-web`, `apps/pos-electron`, `packages/design-system`, or `packages/db-typeorm`.

## Stack (see package.json)

- Node.js >= 20, pnpm 9.x, TypeScript 5.8
- NestJS 11, TypeORM via `@nestjs/typeorm`, `pg`
- Next.js 15, React 19, Tailwind 4
- Electron 36 + electron-vite + better-sqlite3
- UI: shadcn in `packages/ui` only
- Validation: **class-validator** on Nest DTOs; shared regex helpers in `packages/shared/src/validation.ts`
- Auth: **custom Nest JWT** (argon2 passwords). Not Supabase Auth, Clerk, Zod-first DTOs, React Query, or Zustand.

## Naming

- Files: `kebab-case.ts`
- Classes / types: `PascalCase`
- DB tables/columns: `snake_case`
- TypeORM fields: `camelCase` mapped with `@Column({ name: "snake_case" })`
- API paths: `/kebab-case/...` (auth, users, devices, inventory, sync) — not `/inv/...` module prefixes
- Shared field validators: `PERSON_NAME_PATTERN`, `usernameError()`, etc.

## NestJS (`apps/api`)

- Entry: `apps/api/src/main.ts` (port 4000). Health: `GET /health`.
- Modules live next to features (`auth/`, `users/`, `roles/`, `devices/`, `tenants/`, `sync/`, `inventory/*`) — not `src/modules/{pos,aud,inv}`.
- Controllers stay thin. Inject TypeORM repositories into **services**, not controllers.
- Example inventory module: `apps/api/src/inventory/brands/`.
- Guards: `JwtAuthGuard` then `PermissionsGuard`. Authorize by **permission keys** from `@blackbox/shared`, never role names (`OWNER`).
- `@RequirePermissions(...keys)` is AND. Tenant always from JWT, never from the client body/query.
- DTOs: class-validator (`@IsEmail`, `@Matches` using shared patterns). Shared types in `@blackbox/shared`.

## Data access

```
NestJS → TypeORM → Supabase PostgreSQL
```

- Entities: `apps/api/src/db/entities/`
- Config: `apps/api/src/db/db.module.ts` — `DATABASE_URL`, **`synchronize: false`**
- Schema: **only** `supabase/migrations/` (SQL). Never TypeORM migrations. Never a second ORM.

## Tenant isolation (current)

Primary enforcement is **app-layer**, not Postgres RLS.

- JWT `tenantId` → request ALS (`RequestTenantInterceptor`) → `FixedTenantContext` / `@CurrentUser()`
- Every query must filter `tenant_id` from that context
- RLS is **not** enabled. Do not add RLS policies or `RlsMiddleware` unless the dedicated RLS PR is the task.
- Unauthenticated inventory fallback to `DEV_TENANT_ID` is legacy; do not expand it.

## Auth (not Supabase Auth)

- Signup/login/refresh/logout in `apps/api/src/auth/`
- Access JWT: `sub`, `tenantId`, optional `deviceId` (15m); refresh 7d
- Desktop login (`client: "desktop"` + fingerprint) binds a `devices` row
- Admin trusts/revokes devices; `/sync/*` requires a trusted device + `sync.use`
- Web and desktop call the Nest auth API. They do not talk to Supabase Auth.

## Sync (desktop offline-first)

- Cloud is the only hub. Protocol: `POST /sync/push`, `GET /sync/pull`, status, full-resync-complete
- Local SQLite per bound device; outbox + applied log + cursors
- Local writes: IPC `window.blackbox.sync.commit` (renderer → main)
- Renderer **may** call the HTTP API (auth, incremental sync). Do not invent “all HTTP only from main.”
- Auto-sync: trusted session only; backoff up to 5 minutes; queued changes are not dropped
- Docs: `docs/sync.md`

## Shared UI

- Add shadcn components only in `packages/ui` (`pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <name> -c packages/ui`)
- Apps import `@blackbox/ui/button`, etc. Do not fork components into web/desktop
- No `next/image` or `next/link` inside `packages/ui`

## Web (`apps/web`)

- Next App Router under `apps/web/src/app/` (admin at `/app`, not `(dashboard)/`)
- Example: `apps/web/src/app/app/users/`
- Session + permission gates in existing auth components; fetch via `apps/web/src/lib/` helpers
- Field validation: shared helpers, live errors under the field (`aria-invalid`)

## Desktop (`apps/desktop`)

```
apps/desktop/src/main/      # Electron main, SQLite
apps/desktop/src/preload/   # contextBridge → window.blackbox
apps/desktop/src/renderer/  # Vite + React + react-router-dom
```

- Example UI: `apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/features/`
- Package: `pnpm --filter @blackbox/desktop package`

## Commands

```bash
pnpm dev:api        # API :4000
pnpm dev:web        # web :3000
pnpm dev:desktop
pnpm typecheck && pnpm lint
```

## Git

- Do not rename apps to match old drafts
- Do not add RLS, Zod DTOs, React Query, or Supabase Auth unless explicitly asked
